stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> INITIALIZING
  INITIALIZING --> READY: all startup gates + reconciliation pass
  INITIALIZING --> PAUSED_UNSAFE: required fact missing / invalid
  READY --> ACTIVE: strategy activated
  ACTIVE --> RECONCILING: disconnect / gap / ambiguous order / mismatch
  READY --> RECONCILING: uncertainty detected
  RECONCILING --> ACTIVE: consistent active position/orders restored
  RECONCILING --> READY: no active position or working order
  RECONCILING --> PAUSED_UNSAFE: incomplete or inconsistent evidence
  PAUSED_UNSAFE --> RECONCILING: explicit operator recovery request
  ACTIVE --> PAUSED_UNSAFE: safety invariant fails
  READY --> PAUSED_UNSAFE: safety invariant fails
  INITIALIZING --> STOPPED: explicit stop
  READY --> STOPPED: explicit stop
  ACTIVE --> STOPPED: explicit stop
  RECONCILING --> STOPPED: explicit stop
  PAUSED_UNSAFE --> STOPPED: explicit stop
  STOPPED --> INITIALIZING: explicit start; reconcile again